:: Carter Yard Play Swings [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> are lazying about in the sun, lying in the grass beneath the jungle gym in the perfect spot to shield your eyes while still allowing you to stare up at the sky and point out interesting looking clouds. <span style="Color: LightGreen">It is as you are doing this that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> suddenly sits up with an idea.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Swim",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, did you want to swing?”</span> He asks, pointing to the jungle gym that did in fact have two swings attached to it. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You can’t really go as high as the ones at the school or park, but it’s still pretty fun! What do you say? You wouldn’t let a friend swing alone, would you?”</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">You chuckle at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s comment and agree, the happy boy jumping to his feet and helping you up.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We used to have one of those baby ones, but I finally convinced dad to replace it a few years back, since no one could use it and they don’t plan to have anymore kids.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> laughs as he plops onto the swing and begins to kick his feet. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I actually dared <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> to sit in it once; it was a few years ago when he was our age, but he was still pretty big. He got stuck and dad had to unhook it from the swings. It was so funny, looked like a big diaper and he lost his shorts AND underwear when dad finally managed to pull it off.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> laughs as he reminiscences, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It was really funny, especially since <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> doesn’t get shy and just started dancing around like an idiot until mom made him put clothes back on. I was kinda scared at the time since I thought I hurt him by making him get stuck, but it was all nice in the end.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: Pink">You can’t help but smile as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> reminiscences about the story, suspecting that his brother’s silly, embarrassing dance without pants may have been a way to cheer up his worried little brother. The way <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> talks about <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span>, they clearly are very close.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> sees you staring at him smiling and gives you a weird look. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What are you doing, weirdo? Come on, swing with me!”</span> <span style="Color: Pink">He kicks his legs up again, looking so carefree swinging in just his swimming trunks, still a little damp from the pool.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Swing with him<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        You sit down next to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> and begin to kick your legs up as well, swinging alongside him. <span style="Color: LightGreen">The activity eventually becomes a little competitive between you two, as a silent contest of who can go higher begins. You both are skilled and gain some decent height,</span> <span style="Color: Yellow">though the jungle gym doesn’t seem to be made for your extreme skills as it begins to rock and shake about rather worriedly, causing you both to slow down and freeze before laughing nervously.</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "Carter",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Swim",
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Maybe we should take it easy, huh?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> laughs and the two of you begin a more relaxing swinging as you chat. One such topic is you asking if <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> has ever considered swinging high and jumping off to try and land in the pool. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No way! That’s way too far, I’ll just hit the concrete!”</span> He laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Plus, pretty sure that would get me in trouble if I tried. Dad’s big on safety.”</span> That’s fair, though it still would be fun. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“True.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> agrees with a nod. <br>
        <span style="color:Red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 10>>
        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Backyard Swim]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Push him on the swings<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        Instead of swinging with him, you decide to join him in a more intimate way. <span style="Color: Pink">Walking up behind the boy, you begin to push him on the swing, causing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> to laugh.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I didn’t mean like that! I’m not a baby!”</span> He says, though doesn’t seem to stop you. <span style="Color: LightGreen">You claim that he doesn’t have to be a baby to get some pushes on the swings.</span> You do it for your little brother all the time. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, but I’m not your little brother!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> responds with a laugh, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“And if I was your brother, we’d be the same age! Just because I’m short doesn’t mean I’m little!”</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "Carter",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Swim",
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>
            
        <span style="Color: Pink">You laugh and agree, though continue to push him, enjoying the view as his red trunks, the only thing he is wearing, ride down a little from the swing. And you know that is the only thing he is wearing, since as they ride down you get a pretty good view of the top of his butt, slightly damp and looking very soft. You consider that a reward for being such a good ‘big brother’ to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>.</span> <br>
        <span style="color:Red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 10>>
        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Backyard Swim]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>